641:     /**
642:      * Shuts down the mini cluster, failing all currently executing jobs. The mini cluster can be
643:      * started again by calling the {@link #start()} method again.
644:      *
645:      * <p>This method shuts down all started services and components, even if an exception occurs in
646:      * the process of shutting down some component.
647:      *
648:      * @return Future which is completed once the MiniCluster has been completely shut down
649:      */
650:     @Override
651:     public CompletableFuture<Void> closeAsync() {
652:         return closeInternal(true);
653:     }
