104:      *
105:      * @param jarFile The jar file which contains the plan.
106:      * @param classpaths Additional classpath URLs needed by the Program.
107:      * @param entryPointClassName Name of the class which generates the plan. Overrides the class
108:      *     defined in the jar file manifest.
109:      * @param configuration Flink configuration which affects the classloading policy of the Program
110:      *     execution.
111:      * @param args Optional. The arguments used to create the pact plan, depend on implementation of
112:      *     the pact plan. See getDescription().
113:      * @throws ProgramInvocationException This invocation is thrown if the Program can't be properly
114:      *     loaded. Causes may be a missing / wrong class or manifest files.
115:      */
116:     private PackagedProgram(
117:             @Nullable File jarFile,
118:             List<URL> classpaths,
119:             @Nullable String entryPointClassName,
120:             Configuration configuration,
121:             SavepointRestoreSettings savepointRestoreSettings,
122:             String... args)
123:             throws ProgramInvocationException {
124:         this.classpaths = checkNotNull(classpaths);
