59:  *
60:  * <pre>{@code
61:  *   Source              Source
62:  *      +                   +
63:  *      |                   |
64:  *      v                   v
65:  *  Rebalance          HashPartition
66:  *      +                   +
67:  *      |                   |
68:  *      |                   |
69:  *      +------>Union<------+
70:  *                +
71:  *                |
72:  *                v
73:  *              Split
74:  *                +
75:  *                |
76:  *                v
77:  *              Select
78:  *                +
79:  *                v
80:  *               Map
81:  *                +
82:  *                |
83:  *                v
84:  *              Sink
